WEBVTT

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:06.100
Here in Kyoto, we're about to welcome a hearty New Year...

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.750
At the Watsuki Shrine, there's a huge line of people waiting to hear the bell toll on New Year's Eve.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.760
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:12.700
Aha...!

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.730
Ooh...!

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.480
You look great.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.890
If you look like that, it'll make Yuuto-san very happy.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.080
Huh!? Mother!!

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:30.390
But doesn't the New Year's Day visit to the shrine remind you of that time...?

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:31.350
Darling?

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:33.940
Oh! ...uh, I guess...

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:35.690
That time...?

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:39.980
It was before we got married...

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:46.730
We were just around your guys' age when we made the New Year's Day visit to the shrine together...

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:52.630
On our way home, we saw the first sunrise at a nearby place called Ouse-Misaki.

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:57.050
At Ouse-Misaki, there's a legend that...

00:00:57.310 --> 00:01:04.870
If you see the first sunrise with the person you truly want to be with and exchange a kiss, you will be together forever...

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:08.560
...something like that...

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.360
Right? Darling?

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:11.700
Uh, yes...

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:16.590
...the person...who you truly...want to be with...

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:18.540
Ha-Haruka!!

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:22.780
Th-that look on your face! Are you thinking about that guy again!?!?

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:25.280
You mustn't!! You must not!!!!

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:29.700
On New Year's, those sorts of outrageous thoughts will not be tolerated by me, the father...!!

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:32.130
Gyumumu...

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:33.040
My, my.

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:34.560
Uhuhuhu...

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.040
Yuuto-san...

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:13.210
("My Body is Burning up...")

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:14.850
Wow!!!!!

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:16.850
This is designed just like the anime!!

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:23.840
This shrine is the time-honored, super famous shrine that was used as the setting for the Bou-Anime before!

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:28.830
(The fans called it "Pilgrimage", and this was the first place everyone came to...)

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:25.430
Geez...

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:27.120
On New Year's...

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:28.420
Can't follow...

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:29.850
Ah!!!!

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.260
I spot a Miko-san!!

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:31.770
What!!

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:32.400
Miko-san!?

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:33.210
Where, where!?

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:34.030
...you guys...

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.590
Wow~~

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:37.750
Wonderful, wonderful!

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:39.640
Superb!

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:40.970
That red hakama-skirt!

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:41.930
Yahoo~!

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:46.490
Happy New Year~!

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:47.460
Happy New Year.

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:51.230
Man, a long-sleeved kimono, I'm stoked~

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:55.820
A fresh lewd mood from a classmate that you're so familiar with...

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:56.790
Viva! New Year's.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.120
New Year's filled with idiots.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:00.520
Ahaha...

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:06.330
Oh...

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:10.510
Everyone, sorry to keep you waiting...

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:16.650
Happy New Year.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:19.230
Yay! Happy New Year!

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:21.230
Happy New Year~

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:22.220
Happy New Year.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:23.840
She's so mesmerizing...

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:26.340
To New Year's, Nuit-Etoile...

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:27.770
Mamma mia...

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:32.570
I should've worn a kimono too...

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:34.570
Hmm, I'm in awe...

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:36.400
You can't compete with that~!

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.980
Huh!? I-I don't think...so!

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:41.820
Alright, then let's go visit the shrine~

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.700
Um, Yuuto-san?

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:47.690
Hm?

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:50.400
Um...after this...

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:52.700
Kyaaah!! Haruka-onee-sama!?

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:54.860
It is! Haruka-onee-sama!!

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:56.990
Could we join you~?

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.710
Haruka-onee-sama!

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.710
Senpai!

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:03.010
Ha-Haru...

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:03.900
Uh...

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.000
Okay! Senpai! Let's go!

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.230
Let's go!

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.320
Um...uh...

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:08.970
Let's go!

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:13.630
Please let me have a real girlfriend this year!

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:18.090
I won't ask for much, so bust more than 86 and hip 88, blonde and pale...

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:20.370
Any age, as long as she's legal.

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:23.420
I hope there will be sequels to "Mari-Mite" and "Index"~

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:25.630
What is that...

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:33.410
Okay, Senpai, let's go~!

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:34.980
What did you wish for?

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:34.680
Oh...

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:37.660
Here, please take this fortune slip #15.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:39.400
Wow! "Very good luck"!

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.910
Amazing~ I only got "Average luck"!

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:44.520
Why!?

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:46.840
Why are all three of us "Extremely bad luck"!?

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:48.860
No way! Must make second attempt!

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.380
It's way too awful!!

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:53.570
A chance in love is fast...approaching!?

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:56.350
Next week, su-sudden development!?!?

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:57.850
R-really!?

00:05:57.980 --> 00:05:58.890
Next week!?!?

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.150
#7, huh?

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:04.420
Here, #7~

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:06.600
Here, onii-san,

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:07.800
#7, right?

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:08.450
Hm?

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:09.790
hmmm?

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:11.300
Wh-what is it?

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.540
Oh! It is Mika!!

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:14.860
You got it~!

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:17.870
Well, well, how did you know~?

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.310
Great job, Yuuto-sama. I'm completely beat.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.310
koku koku

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.730
What are you guys doing...

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:26.200
It's not like we're playing around~

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:29.970
We're helping out rank No.10 Hinaasaki Iwai-chan~

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:34.810
She's a real Miko-san, so she's really busy on New Year's~

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:38.340
Hey, hey! What did onii-san's fortune slip say?

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:39.650
Hm? Oh...

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.250
(Very Good Luck -love chance. Spend time alone with her and something good will happen)

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:42.530
Love chance...?

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:44.170
Hey, is this...?

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:45.960
Yup, yup. We made it.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.770
Well, well~it's good luck if you spend time alone with her~?

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:52.160
Yuuto-sama, you must act now!

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:53.010
koku koku!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:55.020
Look here...

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:56.370
Hmmm...

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.500
Dang it, dang this fortune slip!

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:00.350
I'm not taking this thing home!

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:02.390
Take this! Take this!!

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:05.630
Wow~it says this year, "Lady-X Bato" is gonna become an anime!

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:08.900
Also, it says that really popular work is gonna be in the theaters~~

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:10.490
What kind of fortune slip is that?

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.490
Now, now, onee-sama!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.730
Let's draw our fortune slip, too.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.000
Oh! Yuuto-san!

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:17.260
Haruka!

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:18.280
Uh...

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:22.580
Hurry! Hurry! Fortune slip! Fortune slip!

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:27.090
I'm happy that they're so friendly...

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:28.300
...but...

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:31.190
but I want to be with Yuuto-san...

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:33.790
Here, onee-chan's is this one.

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:34.640
...what?

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:39.850
("Very good luck"! Go for it!!!)

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:42.930
Mika...!

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:44.330
Okay!!

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:47.850
Onee-sama~

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:50.800
We're going to go karaoke now, so~

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:53.250
If you'd like, Senpai, why don't you come with us?

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:54.530
Senpai?

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:56.950
This is it for today!

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:57.940
I'm sorry!

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:59.190
What~!?

00:07:59.050 --> 00:07:59.630
Bye!

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:01.960
Oh! Haruka-onee-sama!

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:01.980
Onee-sama!

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:04.450
Senpai!!

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:06.740
Aww, why, onee-sama...?

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:10.880
Okay then, we're gonna go stay over at Ryouko's house now.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:15.540
We'll go to a restaurant to debate about long-sleeved kimonos and Miko outfits!

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:16.500
Ohh!

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.950
I gotta go read the doujinshi I bought too~

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:20.330
Bye, guys~

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:21.640
Alright, see ya.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.900
let's see...I'll...

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.260
Yu...Yuuto-san!

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.230
...Haruka...

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:31.870
Uh, um, Yuuto-san!

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:34.150
Do you have time after this?

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:37.470
Uh, yeah. I do, but...

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:39.150
O-okay.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.400
Then, could you please come with me?

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:44.260
...uh, yeah...

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.160
Onee-chan's done well~

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:49.110
koku koku

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:54.980
She's probably going to Gentou-sama and Akiho-sama's memorable place, Ouse-Misaki~

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:58.360
We must capture their precious moments on camera...!

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:01.690
Excuse me, where's the fortune slip stand?

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.410
Do you have the charm-arrows?

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.150
haaaah...

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:06.890
This was unexpected.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:09.090
Our chance is slipping away~

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:09.910
uhh...

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:17.880
...Haruka...?

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:18.760
What's up...?

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:19.920
n-no!

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:22.250
It-it-it's nothing!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:25.900
Hey, after visiting the shrine, wanna go see the first sunrise?

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:27.800
Oh, first sunrise sounds good!

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.550
Yeah, I'm in!

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:34.450
At that cape, if you kiss, it's said that you'll be happy forever.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:35.390
Stop it, you.

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:38.650
Haruka, do you have a fever or something?

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:39.830
N-no!

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:42.010
it-it-it's nothing like that...!

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.630
Hauuu...

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:45.610
Haru...ka!?

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:46.650
Kyaah!

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:46.670
Wah!

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:47.840
Ouch!

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:47.860
Ou!

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:49.860
Yu-Yuuto-san?

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:51.070
Are you okay?

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.800
Um...you too...?

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.200
Hey you!

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:58.330
Don't  just stand there like a dumb obstacle!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.650
I'm in a hurry here!

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:01.250
What?

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:01.920
Geez!

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:06.200
Well, it's fine. I'll just think that I tripped over a Genbu-rock or Kasei-rock or something!

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:08.270
You know, you're the one who...

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.490
By the way, are you hurt?

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:10.970
Oh, nah...

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:13.190
Alright, that's good.

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:14.180
Geh!?

00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:17.170
What's wrong?

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:19.850
Shush! Become a shielding object for a little bit!

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:21.710
Here! Get closer!

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:25.710
Geez, really, where did you go~?

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:31.600
Is she gone? Geez, Yayoi is so annoying...

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.280
What did you do?

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:35.240
Caused an injury or defamation?

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:35.940
What!

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.290
No way!

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.740
Besides, where the heck did you get those ideas!?

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:41.740
Well it's okay, I'm going now!

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:45.800
For the time being, I'll just apologize for bumping into you and thank you for shielding me.

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:47.810
Sorry, thanks!

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:50.280
Oh, he-hey!

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:53.310
What the heck was that...

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:00.250
Um, excuse me.

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:01.120
Y-yes!

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:01.120
Y-yes!

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.390
S-sorry...

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:10.390
did you happen to see a girl in a hat with a star sticker by her eye with a bad mouth?

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:13.060
Uh, well...

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:16.590
The recording is starting soon, that Milan...!

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:19.620
Or does she just hate me after all...?

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:21.010
Sob sob sob.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:21.690
Uh, um...

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:24.200
O-oh, I'm sorry,

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.880
acting like this in front of a stranger...huh?

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:29.190
Are you...?

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.350
Y-yes!?

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:31.230
What's your name!?

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:32.510
It's Haruka...

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:34.520
um, No-Nogizaka Haruka...

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.110
Right, you're Nogizaka-san!

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:39.080
Um, has Nogizaka-san already signed with an office....?

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:39.660
Ooh!

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:43.830
Yes! It's Kayahara! Yes!

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:46.730
What!? She's back? Is that true!?

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:49.090
Just now, yes, like nothing happened?

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:51.500
Yes! Yes! I'll be right there!

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:53.900
Oh, I'm so s-sorry!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:55.290
I really have to go now!

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:59.430
For the time being, Nogizaka-san, could you just take this for me?

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:01.790
Just contact me when you feel like it!

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.500
Uh, um, what's this!?

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:03.520
Bye now!

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.320
Uh...um...

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:09.320
What is that thing?

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:10.740
Huh...

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:12.790
(Three Piece Production, Chief Manager Kayahara Yayoi)

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:17.750
(Happy New Year.)

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:15.800
Happy New Year!

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:22.840
(Good luck!!)

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:21.210
Good luck, onee-chan!

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:28.170
"There's no more time~!!"

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:32.440
"come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, with you!"

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:36.020
Woooooooh...

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.220
It's so loud here...

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:40.260
Didn't know there was live music going on.

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:41.720
Yes...

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:45.990
...what's going on, you seem off...is there something worrying you...?

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:46.660
Uh,

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:48.470
um, Yuuto-san...

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:49.500
Kyah!?

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:50.270
Haru...!?

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:51.370
Oh...oh...

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.020
teehee...I'm okay...

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:56.870
Oh!...Yu!...

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:57.810
Yuuto-san!?

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.280
B-but, hey!

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:02.950
You kind of seem like you need help...right?

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:04.710
Y-yes...

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:13.930
They're so lovey-dovey already on New Year's Day.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:15.540
How cute~

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:19.080
We definitely must capture this moment.

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:20.910
May I ask what you are doing?

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:21.410
Giku.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:22.730
Awawawa!!

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:24.470
Umm, th-this is just...!!

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.610
Um...how can I say...

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:29.490
we're not at all suspicious or anything and...

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:31.800
Could I ask you some questions?

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:33.920
We're very sorry~!

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:34.360
Oh, hey!!

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:35.070
Stop there!!

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:36.360
Stop~~!

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:38.960
Did something happen?

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:41.320
It's still New Year's Day and there's already trouble...

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:42.710
...yes...

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:44.030
Hm?

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:52.260
Um...! Yuuto-san.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:52.610
Hm?

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:55.110
Um...was it okay?

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:58.330
You don't even know where we're going...but...

00:13:58.620 --> 00:13:59.930
you're here...

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.090
Hmm...

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:04.720
well I guess I do kind of want to know the destination...

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:07.550
but, it's where Haruka wants to go, right?

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:10.110
Then, I've no problem coming along.

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.010
...Yuuto-san...

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:14.820
Hehe...

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:15.690
Hehe...

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:17.200
Hm?

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:19.540
Is that...sweet sake?

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:21.000
Haruka, do you want to try it?

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:21.860
Huh?

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:22.660
Yes.

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:26.230
It looks like it's free, and we're kind of getting cold so...

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:27.480
hold on!

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:32.210
Here, it's hot, be careful.

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:33.780
Thank you very much.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:41.120
Wow...

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:42.320
this is so good!

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:45.810
These things are so much better when you drink it outside.

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:47.400
You're right.

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:49.960
That's probably part of that reason, but...

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:55.400
I think the real reason is...

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:57.880
because Yuuto-san's here with me now.

00:14:58.280 --> 00:14:58.710
What!?

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:02.220
I think it tastes so good because I'm with Yuuto-san now...

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:05.010
It's all thanks to Yuuto-san...

00:15:11.210 --> 00:15:12.510
I'm s-sorry!

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:14.650
I said something weird all of the sudden!

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:17.680
Maybe I'm a little drunk...

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:21.180
I'll go throw this p-paper cup away!

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:22.300
Ah!?

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:23.110
Kyaaah!!

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:23.490
Haruka!

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.180
A-are you okay?

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:27.250
Y-yes...

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:29.280
I'm sorry...oh!?

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:29.850
What's wrong?

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:31.410
Uh, um...

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:32.740
to tell you the truth, um...!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:34.610
Just now...

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.850
my kimono has become undone...

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:37.800
Yeek!?

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:45.350
It looks safe here..

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:46.660
Y-yes,

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:47.790
I'm sorry...

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.970
Okay, I'll wait for you outside.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.150
W-wait, please!

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:51.490
What!?

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:52.690
Uh, um...

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:55.590
if it's okay, could you please stay here with me!?

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:58.360
Um, I feel scared alone...

00:15:58.620 --> 00:15:59.660
Uh, but...

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:00.870
Please!

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:04.230
I don't want to be alone in th-this dark...

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.160
O-okay...

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:12.140
Thank you very much.

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:15.000
Then please wait there for a little bit.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:16.850
Y-yeah.

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:20.690
Wa...wah...

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:22.470
ah...ah...

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:30.200
Ah!

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:31.650
Wha-what...!

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.420
What's wrong!? Haruka!?

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:36.910
Um, I just tripped on the skirt a little...

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.830
I...I see...

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:40.610
Kyaaaaaah!

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:42.500
Th-there! What was that sound!?

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:46.070
Aaaaaaaah!!

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:46.420
Waaaaah!!

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:53.300
Ouch...

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:56.830
s-sorry...

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:58.330
n-nah...

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.140
meow...

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:02.400
kitty-cat...was that you...?

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:03.710
I guess so...

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:05.640
Ha...haha...

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:06.900
Hm?

00:17:08.600 --> 00:17:10.050
...uh, um...

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:14.550
Yu-

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.010
Yuuto-san...

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:20.690
I don't know but...my body's burning up...

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:24.470
What's happening to me...?

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:28.160
Ha-Haruka...!

00:17:29.530 --> 00:17:31.290
Yuuto...san...

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:47.660
Ouch!?

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:52.870
Ouch...wh-what was that, geez!!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:56.350
Uh, Haruka, were you okay? Just now...?

00:17:57.640 --> 00:17:58.300
Yes!

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:13.120
I'm s-sorry...

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:16.180
dragging you to such a ragged road like this...

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:19.140
No worries...besides...are you okay?

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.400
Y-yes, I'm okay.

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:24.070
I might look weak, but I have good endurance.

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:25.060
Oh..aah!?

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:27.580
Uh, um...

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:28.670
I'm sorry...

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.360
Hmm...oh.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.810
Okay! Haruka, stay still for a bit!

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:35.380
Here!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.380
Aah! Yu-Yuuto-san!?

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:40.210
This way, your kimono won't get dirty either, so it works, right?

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:41.890
b-bu-bu-bu-but...

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:46.170
o-okay then, I'll leave it up to you...

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:47.740
okay, let's go.

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:48.970
Y-yes.

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:17.530
Amazing...

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.390
It's a great view...

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.090
so this is where Haruka wanted to come to.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:26.380
Yes, this is Ouse-Misaki...

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:30.010
Father and Mother's memorable place...

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:35.240
Yuuto-san...

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:37.920
thank you very much for today, really.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:39.460
Hm?

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:42.910
For coming here without questioning...

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.090
Also, if it wasn't for Yuuto-san,

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:48.520
I wouldn't have been able to make it this far...

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:54.470
There's a special meaning for Yuuto-san and me to be here together...

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:57.650
A special...meaning?

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:02.630
This past year in which I met Yuuto-san...

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:05.360
To me,

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:10.000
it's a truly unforgettable, special year...

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:15.840
Even after Yuuto-san found out about my secret, you always stayed by my side...

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:21.390
This year's memories are all memories of Yuuto-san.

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:30.280
So I wanted to come here with Yuuto-san...

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:33.790
to this special place...together...

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:37.400
...a special...place...?

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:45.640
Wow...

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:00.280
Amazing...

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:04.880
Oh.

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:06.610
Um...

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.850
was it really not any trouble for you...?

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:13.010
Didn't I tell you before...?

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:17.510
I came along because it was a place Haruka wanted to come to...

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:21.290
I, too, wanted to be with Haruka, so...

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:22.660
Huh?!

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:23.710
Yuuto-san...!

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:26.270
Uh, um...

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:29.240
just one...can I ask for one favor?

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:31.410
Yeah, ask me anything.

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:33.530
Um, then...

00:21:34.900 --> 00:21:37.530
if you could close your eyes for a little moment...

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:39.640
Like this?

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:44.470
Ha-Happy New...Year.

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:54.520
Uh!?

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:57.080
Uh, um...

00:21:57.660 --> 00:21:59.280
I heard from Mother that...

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:03.910
I-if you come here with the person you truly want to be with and do this...

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:07.080
Y-you...will be together forever...

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:13.080
Uh...um...yeah, so...

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:14.860
thanks, then.

00:22:14.940 --> 00:22:19.030
Oh...ah! Yes! N-no problem! You're welcome!

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:19.020
(Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals)

00:24:16.750 --> 00:24:18.460
Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals!

00:24:18.520 --> 00:24:20.480
Yuuto, do you know what "Yan-dere" is?

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:29.940
(Yan-dere)

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:20.820
Huh?

00:24:20.940 --> 00:24:25.480
It's when you like someone so much that you become ill from it...huhuhu...

00:24:25.230 --> 00:24:26.440
Shi-shiina?

00:24:26.110 --> 00:24:28.570
(mumble mumble)

00:24:26.440 --> 00:24:30.950
The squid rice I made for Yuuto...squid rice...squid rice...squid rice...

00:24:29.940 --> 00:24:35.740
(Next: "It Might Have Gone in...")

00:24:30.810 --> 00:24:33.980
Waah! Shiina is...! Shiina is...!!!

00:24:33.940 --> 00:24:35.620
Why don't you just date her!!

00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:41.280
(See you next week!)

00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:41.280
(Nogizaka Haruka no Himitsu-Purezza)
